      "webpage": {
        "text": "Medium\n\nOlympic flame handover ceremony at the Panathenaic stadium in Athens\n\n\nAfter a six-day trek across Greece, the flame that was lit last Thursday by the sun’s rays at the birthplace of the Games in Ancient Olympia was presented to the Brazilian organizers.\n\n\nPhotos: Panayotis Tzamaros / FOS PHOTOS\n\n\nIf you liked this photo-story, please click on the ♥ below to recommend it to your friends, and follow us to catch the next one. Thanks!\n\nDon’t forget to like us on Facebook, follow us on Twitter and Instagram, and subscribe to our YouTube channel.\n\nIf you have any corrections, ideas, or even profanities to share, feel free to email us info@athenslive.gr",
